														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4401797">
									

<p>That still doesn't make her &quot;stupid&quot;.</p>
<p>• The phone may be her only hope at contacting the outside world; you don't know what's on the other side.</p>
<p>• She probably doesn't know/remember how she got there or any of the other details. Or she might be giving them that information in her attempts to plead for help; we weren't given the full details of what she's saying.</p>
<p>They do say they attempt to track the call and it isn't possible.</p>
<p>I'm going to go ahead and NOT ASSUME that she's stupid. If she would deliberately minimize her chances of survival, yeah she'd be stupid. But there's a lot of mystery to this article, and it's a very strange to assume without sufficient evidence that someone is purposely withholding information that may free them from something like this.</p>

							</div>

								
